    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nDNG Estate Agents take pleasure in presenting 127 Esker Lawns, a lovely 3 bedroom extended semi-detached family home set in a most sought area located only a short stroll from Lucan Village. This property benefits from a most private rear garden, is a blank canvas specification and offers a chain free opportunity for the discerning purchaser.\n\n127 Esker Lawns is situated in a quiet, tree line road, with ample off-street parking to the front, a spacious driveway along with a gated pedestrian side access to the exceptionally sunny rear garden. The property is in need of modernisation and refurbishmet but could easily be transformed into an impressive family home.\n\nThe light filled accommodation comprises of entrance hallway, a spacious living room to the front, a dining room, kitchen, guest bathroom and 4th bedroom/home office on ground floor level. Upstairs are three well-proportioned bedrooms and a family bathroom. \n\nEsker Lawns is a mature, convenient & popular residential development close to Lucan village, ideally located just minutes from a host of cafés, restaurants, pubs and shops. This wonderful area is readily accessible to both the M4, M50 & beyond. Public transport is excellent with bus services nearby. Both primary and secondary schools are also within walking distance.\n\nThis area is close to many leisure facilities including GAA clubs, soccer clubs, water sports along the River Liffey and within easy reach of the recently opened Lucan Swimming Pool. The area is close to parks including St Catherine's & Griffeen Valley Park. Shopping centres are also within easy reach with Liffey Valley Shopping Centre, Fonthill Retail Park & Lucan Shopping Centre nearby.\n\nTo arrange an appointment to view please call Audrey Higgins in DNG Estate Agents on 01 6280400."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "\nEntrance Porch - 0.97m x 2.70\nSliding doors with tiled flooring\n\nEntrance Hallway - 1.79m x 3.37m\nWooden flooring, under stair storage with doors to\n\nLiving Room - 3.40m x 4.21\nCarpet flooring, panelled wooden wall, stone fireplace with marble surround, gas fire\n\nKitchen/Dining Room - 4.03m x 3.18m\nLamite flooring with partition between kitchen area and dining area, door to rear garden, door from dining area to rear hallway\n\nRear Hall - 2.15m x 1.98m\nContinuation of laminte flooring, door to\n\nGuest Bathroom - 1.87m x 1.98m\nTiled flooring with part tiled walls, wc and wash hand basin\n\n4th Bedroom/home office - 3.26m x 3.62m\nRear aspect with carpet flooring\n\nLanding - 2.51m x 4.96m\nCarpet flooring, hot press, attic access\n\nBathroom - 1.53m x 3.06m\nTiled flooring, w.c, wash hand basin, bath with shower attachment,\n\nBedroom 1 - 2.88mx 2.45m\nRear aspect with carpet flooring\n\nBedroom 2 - 3.31m x 3.29m\nRear aspect with carpet flooring\n\nBedroom 3 - 4.01m x 3.66m\nFront aspect with carpet flooring\n\nRear Garden - \nGood sized rear garden with patio and lawn areas, garden shed, totally enclosed with mature planting\n\nFront garden - \nDriveway for off street parking, lawn with mature borders, pedestrian side access gate to rear\n\n"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "<ul><li> 3/4 Bed Semi-detached property</li><li> Gated pedestrian side access</li><li> Good sized driveway with off street parking to the front</li><li> Close to Lucan Village</li><li> Gas fired central heating</li><li> Located minutes from Lucan Village</li><li> St. Mary's Parish</li><li> Close to all amenities, shops, & schools</li><li> Both public transport & Road Network links excellent</ul>"
